OL,3,GNEWSAYork City player pleads not guilty
OL,4,Aover alleged punch of Rochdale fan
OL,5,
OL,6,FA York City FC player has appeared in
OL,7,Fcourt after allegedly punching a
OL,8,FRochdale AFC supporter during a pitch
OL,9,Finvasion.
OL,11,FHiram Boateng, 30, of Leeds, pleaded
OL,12,Fnot guilty at Manchester Magistrates'
OL,13,FCourt on Monday to using threatening,
OL,14,Fabusive or insulting behaviour with
OL,15,Fintent to cause fear of, or provoke,
OL,16,Funlawful violence.
OL,18,FThe charge relates to an incident
OL,19,Finvolving fans who entered the pitch
OL,20,Fduring the final-day match between the
OL,21,Ftwo sides at the Crown Oil Arena on 25
OL,22,FApril.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
