OL,3,GNEWSAYork City player pleads not guilty
OL,4,Aover alleged punch of Rochdale fan
OL,5,
OL,6,FYork City FC said it was "aware of
OL,7,Fdevelopments" following the incident
OL,8,Fand added Boateng, whose trial is due
OL,9,Fto begin on 23 June 2027, "maintains
OL,10,Fthe full support of everyone at York
OL,11,FCity".
